  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MVS/BH_NU_HEADER.png\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D8LKA5N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fS5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/869218732650688543?color=3e72b3&label=DISCORD&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-projects-3e72b3?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge 專案\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFinnDog_123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-projects-3e72b3?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 專案\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fvoyager-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/c110cc09347a4f9f9de6c974f2fa35d8.png\" alt=\"查看結構\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MVS/BH_NU_BANNER1.png\" alt=\"總覽\"></p>\n<p>本模組支援 Forge、Fabric、NeoForge 與 Quilt！亦可僅安裝於伺服器端。1.20.4 之後已不再支援 Forge。</p>\n<h3>關於</h3>\n<p>Moogs Voyager Structures 透過動態且引人入勝的新結構，徹底改變您的 Minecraft 體驗。這些結構使用原版方塊與實體打造，能無縫融入遊戲中，提供豐富的戰利品、具挑戰性的敵對生物以及友善的村民。該模組可與任何整合包相容，在保留經典 Minecraft 氛圍的同時豐富您的世界。加入 Moogs Voyager Structures，展開一場充滿冒險與發現的旅程吧！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fvoyager-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/f8fe835413394a76b10a678afefea30f.png\" alt=\"以 3D 即時瀏覽所有結構\"></a></p>\n<h3>設定資料包</h3>\n<p>模組的每個方面均可透過資料包進行客製化。帶有完整說明文件的範本可<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mvs-moogs-voyager-structure-config-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此處</a>取得。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MVS/BH_NU_BANNER2.png\" alt=\"功能\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/epC7vBE.png\" alt=\"拼貼圖\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MVS/BH_NU_BANNER4.png\" alt=\"展示\"></p>\n<h3>影片</h3>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/C6Mzy-1a7Ys\" width=\"650\" height=\"364\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/z0HMHeHAlZ4?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8e1M7q9xczE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/umTiIV1mpJg?t=21s?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/twKJIl2pZpI?t=49s?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/R0MbDUuVNHU?t=420s?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<h3>整合包</h3>\n<p>查看所有整合包請<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252ffinder%253fincluded_mods%253d37802\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此處</a>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MVS/BH_NU_BANNER3.png\" alt=\"橫幅\"> 獲得回覆的最佳且最快方式是加入我們的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/S5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmoogsmods%253fr%253dcfmvs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MVS/BH_NU_PROMO.png\" alt=\"BH 贊助商\"></a></p>",
